    (uuid "26d24a4b-072a-4b48-b274-88488339693e"))
  (text "1-roll board: no feeders, no second scale, no MCP23017. GPIO3 = BTT runout, GPIO20 = button, GPIO10 = buzzer."
    (at 260 330.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4779066f-5f14-464e-95e4-b32b0971f4c6"))
  (text "U1 antenna at the board edge: no copper, parts or traces under it. USB is data only: plug in 12 V while flashing."
    (at 260 336.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "04be07ab-49f2-4697-a58e-7f7620295fc8"))
  (text "SB1 (U14, C37, J18) and SB2 (U15, C39, J19) are small boards on break-off tabs: their nets (SB1_*, SB2_*) reach the board only through the harness."
    (at 260 342.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "2900212b-8503-4804-800c-e030de59dea8"))
  (text "Heater path J1 -> F1 -> TB2 -> Q1 carries 12.5 A: wide pours, 2 oz copper, copper area under Q1."
